WEBVTT

00:00:00.980 --> 00:00:08.150
Stepping out on
an ordinary Sunday

00:00:08.150 --> 00:00:14.660
Stepping out!
A miracle's gonna happen

00:00:14.660 --> 00:00:16.490
It's my day!

00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:27.070
Maybe I'll throw off my pajamas

00:00:29.540 --> 00:00:34.480
and head out to see her right now

00:00:36.450 --> 00:00:41.850
I always turned my eyes away,
thinking she'd hate me

00:00:43.520 --> 00:00:49.260
Now I'm saying goodbye
to that negative attitude

00:00:50.460 --> 00:00:55.030
My favorite shoes
will always take me

00:00:57.530 --> 00:01:02.170
To a place where I'll be happy

00:01:04.340 --> 00:01:09.680
It's not someone else
I want to embrace

00:01:11.380 --> 00:01:15.820
But a version of
myself that's not fake

00:01:15.820 --> 00:01:18.890
I just want to walk

00:01:19.220 --> 00:01:22.420
Not on tip-toe

00:01:22.660 --> 00:01:26.400
Not downcast, either

00:01:27.360 --> 00:01:35.300
Just I'm stepping out
on an ordinary Sunday

00:01:35.300 --> 00:01:41.740
Stepping out!
Making a little try, try, try

00:01:41.740 --> 00:01:44.010
It's my day!

00:02:14.940 --> 00:02:17.750
Why didn't I...

00:02:18.580 --> 00:02:22.420
fall for a woman like you?

00:03:17.370 --> 00:03:18.820
You're so thin...

00:03:18.820 --> 00:03:21.150
If I held you any tighter,
you'd break.

00:03:21.740 --> 00:03:24.480
I don't care what happens to me.

00:03:34.690 --> 00:03:38.990
<i>Even if the world 
would be ending today...</i>

00:03:40.360 --> 00:03:43.260
<i>Rui Hanazawa would 
be all I could see.</i>

00:03:56.340 --> 00:03:57.520
Tsukasa!

00:03:58.780 --> 00:04:00.310
<i>Domyoji...</i>

00:04:18.160 --> 00:04:26.940
"The Crime and Punishment of a Kiss"

00:04:29.170 --> 00:04:30.140
Rui...

00:04:30.140 --> 00:04:31.440
So that's how it is...

00:04:38.610 --> 00:04:41.560
Is that how you want it, Rui?!

00:05:01.570 --> 00:05:03.210
W-wait...

00:05:04.210 --> 00:05:06.210
Wait! Please listen to me.

00:05:08.640 --> 00:05:10.720
What's left to say after all this?

00:05:13.950 --> 00:05:18.620
I told you I loved you.
I gave all my heart to you.

00:05:19.450 --> 00:05:24.120
But... You just smashed it
into a thousand pieces.

00:05:29.400 --> 00:05:33.670
Sorry... I'm sorry... I...

00:05:36.270 --> 00:05:37.540
Don't touch me!

00:05:42.380 --> 00:05:45.080
I take back everything I ever did
or said to you.

00:05:46.310 --> 00:05:48.550
Don't ever talk to me again.

00:06:04.930 --> 00:06:07.430
How could I let this happen?

00:06:08.600 --> 00:06:10.670
I never meant to hurt him.

00:06:11.640 --> 00:06:13.440
I never meant to...!

00:06:33.160 --> 00:06:36.830
<i>This will be... our room.</i>

00:06:41.270 --> 00:06:42.570
<i>I love you.</i>

00:06:55.850 --> 00:07:01.190
<i>If you say it didn't happen...
I'll believe you.</i>

00:07:04.620 --> 00:07:08.590
<i>I believe in you.</i>

00:07:37.490 --> 00:07:41.540
<i>I believe in you.</i>

00:08:06.720 --> 00:08:09.920
<i>I can't stop shaking.</i>

00:08:19.690 --> 00:08:24.470
<i>But... You just smashed it
into a thousand pieces.</i>

00:08:39.850 --> 00:08:45.590
<i>I... How can I ever look
Domyoji in the eye again?</i>

00:09:01.250 --> 00:09:05.670
Ugh... Tsukushi, I feel sick...

00:09:06.070 --> 00:09:07.620
I think I'm seasick.

00:09:07.620 --> 00:09:10.310
Are you all right, Kazuya?

00:09:10.940 --> 00:09:15.270
I can't believe you call this tub
your fabulous S.S. Aoike!

00:09:16.080 --> 00:09:18.240
Yeah! It's nothing but a tugboat!

00:09:18.240 --> 00:09:20.340
It'll take us two days to
get home at this rate!

00:09:20.340 --> 00:09:23.190
I've got a big test tomorrow.

00:09:24.790 --> 00:09:26.590
Oh, no!

00:09:26.590 --> 00:09:28.430
I don't like it either!

00:09:29.330 --> 00:09:30.730
Kazuya...

00:09:31.330 --> 00:09:34.070
Yeah. I'm fine, Tsukushi...

00:09:37.340 --> 00:09:39.150
Enough, already!!

00:09:39.150 --> 00:09:41.980
Akira, I'm thirsty...

00:09:41.980 --> 00:09:43.210
Yes, ma'am...

00:09:44.440 --> 00:09:46.860
Hey! Don't get sick on
your own boat, moron!

00:09:47.110 --> 00:09:50.400
Yeah, you should've bought a cruiser 
like all the <i>nouveau riches</i> do!!

00:09:52.780 --> 00:09:55.450
Okay, okay... just don't turn around...

00:09:56.120 --> 00:09:58.420
But what the hell is 
wrong with Tsukasa?

00:09:58.890 --> 00:10:00.630
Leaving us behind!

00:10:01.130 --> 00:10:04.700
Yes! And that Sakurako went
right along with him.

00:10:06.260 --> 00:10:07.670
<i>Domyoji...</i>

00:10:21.310 --> 00:10:26.340
<i>No... Every time I think of Domyoji, I...</i>

00:10:28.490 --> 00:10:29.690
You're trembling.

00:10:36.960 --> 00:10:39.200
You're right. How weird...

00:10:50.410 --> 00:10:51.760
Don't worry...

00:10:59.320 --> 00:11:01.080
I'm here.

00:11:05.890 --> 00:11:08.120
<i>Such a cool hand.</i>

00:11:08.120 --> 00:11:11.040
<i>Nothing like Domyoji's warm touch...</i>

00:11:11.040 --> 00:11:12.830
<i>This is Rui Hanazawa's hand.</i>

00:11:13.930 --> 00:11:17.170
<i>This is the hand that I've chosen.</i>

00:11:18.630 --> 00:11:22.570
<i>I'll never see his smile again...</i>

00:11:28.280 --> 00:11:31.710
<i>He'll probably never forgive me.</i>

00:11:37.990 --> 00:11:40.190
<i>Even though he cared for me so much...</i>

00:11:45.330 --> 00:11:46.630
<i>I...</i>

00:11:47.260 --> 00:11:50.300
<i>I trampled on Domyoji's feelings.</i>

00:12:23.960 --> 00:12:31.100
<i>I've got to apologize to Domyoji
with all my heart and soul.</i>

00:12:31.670 --> 00:12:34.160
Tsukushi! Good morning!

00:12:34.160 --> 00:12:35.540
Oh, good morning.

00:12:35.840 --> 00:12:37.710
Sorry for yesterday.

00:12:38.410 --> 00:12:42.380
Two days on the S.S. Aoike
takes it out of you, huh?

00:12:42.880 --> 00:12:44.740
But wasn't it fun?

00:12:45.880 --> 00:12:47.040
Tsukushi?

00:12:47.040 --> 00:12:48.360
Kazuya...

00:12:48.360 --> 00:12:49.380
Yes?

00:12:49.380 --> 00:12:51.720
Have you seen Domyoji?

00:12:51.720 --> 00:12:53.090
Domyoji?

00:12:53.690 --> 00:12:56.510
I saw him over in the quad.

00:12:56.510 --> 00:12:57.330
Oh?

00:12:57.330 --> 00:13:00.430
But I was worried...

00:13:00.430 --> 00:13:02.520
You know, you saw me throwing up
on the boat.

00:13:02.520 --> 00:13:05.470
I was afraid you'd be disappointed in me.

00:13:05.940 --> 00:13:08.760
A guy's gotta be tough.

00:13:08.760 --> 00:13:12.400
I guess I'm pretty green to
get sick so easily.

00:13:12.400 --> 00:13:13.560
Right, Tsukushi?

00:13:13.560 --> 00:13:18.850
Huh? Huh? Where did she go?

00:13:19.750 --> 00:13:21.720
Tsukushi!

00:13:33.360 --> 00:13:35.430
Rui, Tsukasa told us everything.

00:13:37.670 --> 00:13:39.960
What's your problem?

00:13:42.640 --> 00:13:45.410
Rui, listen... You can't do that...

00:13:46.210 --> 00:13:49.380
You knew that Tsukasa was in love
with Makino, didn't you?

00:13:49.750 --> 00:13:52.010
Yeah, I did.

00:13:55.590 --> 00:13:58.410
I don't believe it! The F4 are arguing.

00:13:58.410 --> 00:14:01.140
Never seen this happen before.

00:14:01.140 --> 00:14:02.350
Wow!

00:14:03.630 --> 00:14:07.330
<i>What should I do? It's my fault the F4...</i>

00:14:07.900 --> 00:14:09.660
What do you mean "Yeah, I did"?

00:14:09.660 --> 00:14:13.240
I may have stolen away
a lot of guys' girls, but...

00:14:13.600 --> 00:14:17.010
I'd never take one from a friend!

00:14:17.970 --> 00:14:20.080
I know what I did to Tsukasa was wrong.

00:14:21.710 --> 00:14:23.580
If you knew, you shouldn't have done it!

00:14:24.110 --> 00:14:26.640
So if you can't have Shizuka,
you'll take Makino?

00:14:29.120 --> 00:14:30.670
Listen, you...

00:14:30.670 --> 00:14:31.850
That's enough, Akira.

00:14:32.590 --> 00:14:33.390
Tsukasa...

00:14:39.790 --> 00:14:41.230
Hey, Tsukasa...

00:14:45.130 --> 00:14:46.500
I want him gone.

00:14:47.070 --> 00:14:47.870
Huh?

00:14:48.370 --> 00:14:50.140
I want him gone, now.

00:14:50.670 --> 00:14:51.730
Tsukasa?

00:14:51.730 --> 00:14:54.310
Rui's out of the F4.

00:14:54.680 --> 00:14:55.640
What?!

00:15:05.090 --> 00:15:08.290
Rui... You're nothing,
not even an acquaintance!

00:15:09.890 --> 00:15:11.160
Just a traitor!

00:15:13.160 --> 00:15:15.660
Rui, you're not one of us anymore!

00:15:15.930 --> 00:15:17.350
Is he serious?

00:15:17.350 --> 00:15:19.350
The F4 have split apart!

00:15:19.350 --> 00:15:21.200
Hanazawa's been kicked out!

00:15:24.100 --> 00:15:28.940
<i>No... Why? Why is this happening?</i>

00:15:29.840 --> 00:15:32.080
Go chill out, Rui.

00:15:33.680 --> 00:15:35.450
Uh-oh! They're coming this way!

00:15:40.120 --> 00:15:42.420
<i>What'll I do? What'll I do?</i>

00:15:46.560 --> 00:15:48.030
<i>I've got to apologize...</i>

00:15:53.230 --> 00:15:54.530
<i>I've got to apologize...</i>

00:15:59.840 --> 00:16:01.340
<i>I've got to apologize!</i>

00:16:06.580 --> 00:16:08.080
Domyoji...

00:16:45.880 --> 00:16:49.020
Shouldn't you say something
to Makino?

00:16:49.720 --> 00:16:51.720
She betrayed you, you know...

00:16:52.220 --> 00:16:55.260
Forget her. Don't ever mention
her name again.

00:16:56.460 --> 00:16:57.560
Tsukasa...

00:16:59.160 --> 00:17:03.840
Then, let's go to Roppongi and
party till morning!

00:17:04.600 --> 00:17:06.740
That sounds good. Right, Tsukasa?

00:17:07.500 --> 00:17:09.060
You two go without me.

00:17:09.060 --> 00:17:09.840
Huh?

00:17:22.290 --> 00:17:26.860
<i>He ignored me, like a piece of trash.</i>

00:17:27.790 --> 00:17:31.090
<i>He looked so angry.
I was sure he'd yell at me.</i>

00:17:32.360 --> 00:17:33.560
<i>But he ignored me...</i>

00:17:34.930 --> 00:17:38.510
My dad took me to dinner at
the Imperial Restaurant.

00:17:38.510 --> 00:17:40.200
Their food is wonderful.

00:18:26.580 --> 00:18:28.450
Sorry to interrupt you.

00:18:28.980 --> 00:18:30.080
You didn't.

00:18:35.690 --> 00:18:36.930
I'm sorry...

00:18:37.260 --> 00:18:39.730
You had to leave the F4 because of me.

00:18:40.130 --> 00:18:41.780
Why should you apologize?

00:18:41.780 --> 00:18:44.900
Well, if I hadn't gone to the beach...

00:18:46.300 --> 00:18:48.100
You did nothing wrong.

00:18:49.970 --> 00:18:53.710
I kissed you because I wanted to.

00:19:06.290 --> 00:19:09.050
Oh no! I'm sweating...

00:19:14.730 --> 00:19:17.100
You have nothing to apologize for.

00:19:21.240 --> 00:19:22.740
<i>Don't touch me!</i>

00:19:26.370 --> 00:19:29.940
Oh, this... It looks blank, but...

00:19:31.710 --> 00:19:33.880
If you do this... See?

00:19:36.180 --> 00:19:38.450
Looks like him, don't you think?

00:19:43.220 --> 00:19:45.460
<i>Don't ever talk to me again!</i>

00:19:52.900 --> 00:19:54.170
Makino?

00:20:02.840 --> 00:20:08.950
<i>I never thought it would hurt
so much to be ignored by him.</i>

00:20:12.150 --> 00:20:17.190
<i>I never thought a kiss 
could be such a horrible crime.</i>

00:20:19.760 --> 00:20:20.700
<i>I'm sorry.</i>

00:20:21.890 --> 00:20:25.300
<i>It's silly of me to get so upset.</i>

00:20:25.630 --> 00:20:26.500
Makino...

00:20:28.360 --> 00:20:31.830
This Sunday... 
why don't we go somewhere?
Just the two of us.

00:20:34.170 --> 00:20:35.200
Let's go.

00:20:39.040 --> 00:20:40.050
The two of us?

00:20:40.440 --> 00:20:41.440
Yeah.

00:20:53.620 --> 00:20:54.830
Okay.

00:20:59.600 --> 00:21:02.200
<i>Even if I can't see Domyoji's smile...</i>

00:21:03.200 --> 00:21:05.770
<i>Rui Hanazawa's smile is right here.</i>

00:21:07.400 --> 00:21:10.110
It's set then... This Sunday.

00:21:15.880 --> 00:21:17.180
Sakurako!

00:21:17.910 --> 00:21:21.690
I heard that Rui was kicked out of the F4.

00:21:22.880 --> 00:21:28.390
I guess this means Domyoji's
not your one true love, huh?

00:21:28.790 --> 00:21:29.820
Well, I...

00:21:30.360 --> 00:21:35.140
But not me... I truly love him.
Ever since I was little.

00:21:36.860 --> 00:21:38.700
Stay out of my way.

00:21:39.030 --> 00:21:42.370
Nothing you say can stop me
from making him mine.

00:22:05.160 --> 00:22:11.230
You let your hair down a little

00:22:13.200 --> 00:22:19.110
You hid the fact
that you were crying

00:22:20.870 --> 00:22:28.980
I noticed, but I
couldn't ask you why

00:22:29.210 --> 00:22:37.020
I can never be
honest about how I feel

00:22:37.020 --> 00:22:44.800
Until after we've split
up after a bad fight

00:22:45.060 --> 00:22:52.940
I can say it now,
though, over and over

00:22:45.060 --> 00:22:52.940
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:22:52.940 --> 00:23:01.310
I can say "I love you"...

00:22:52.940 --> 00:23:01.310
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:23:03.110 --> 00:23:11.090
Do you really hate me this time?

00:23:11.090 --> 00:23:18.860
Will you end up running to him?

00:23:19.130 --> 00:23:27.040
I can say it now,
though, over and over

00:23:19.130 --> 00:23:27.040
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:23:27.040 --> 00:23:35.450
I can say "I love you"...

00:23:27.040 --> 00:23:35.450
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:23:47.160 --> 00:23:50.260
A date with Rui Hanazawa!
I've dreamt about this for ages!

00:23:50.790 --> 00:23:53.830
I should've been looking forward to this.

00:23:54.100 --> 00:23:57.070
I should've been giddy with anticipation...

00:23:57.170 --> 00:24:01.640
But memories of Domyoji haunt me.

00:24:02.400 --> 00:24:05.070
Next on Hana Yori Dango:
"A Bewildering First Date!"

00:24:05.610 --> 00:24:08.240
I can't even fight with Domyoji anymore.
